<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4748" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλῠτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, poet.
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλλυτος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phanocl.
					2.1
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.30
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Maced.
			</span></i>), <i>not to be loosed</i> or <i>broken, indissoluble,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέδαι, δεσμοί,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				13.37
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				8.275
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				55
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀδάμας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					12.93
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Rhian.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μοιράων νῆμα</span>
			Phanocl.l.c., cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
				520
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Thessalonica</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτολέμοιο πεῖραρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					13.360
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύκλος</span> (of the wheel of the
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴϋγξ</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				4.215
			</span></i>; <i>irremediable,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				230
			</span></i>(lyr.): of substances, <i>insoluble,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				384b7
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					60c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of arguments or
			evidence, <i>not to be confuted, irrefutable,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1357b17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1403a14
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συλλογισμός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>APr.</u>
					70a29
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>undissolved,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				60e
			</span></i>.</div>
